  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 103.55 Small community water system",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 103.55 “Small community water system” means a community water system that serves fewer than 1,000 residents and does not have fire protection provided by street hydrants.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Dw 100) #10606, eff 6-1-14; renumbered by #10770 (from Env-Dw 103.53); renumbered by #12180 (from Env-Dw 103.54)",
